# 6. Specific Capstone Project Guidelines Verification
# =====================================================================
# DO NOT add the following to your .gitignore! They MUST be committed:
# - orders_dataset.csv (Generated in Part 1)
# - knowledge_base.json (Your 12 policy documents)
# - return_risk_model.pkl (Tuned Part 1 model)
# - product_classifier.pt (Tuned Part 2 model weights)
# - data/sample_images/*.png (5 test images for vision classification)
# - transcripts/*.txt (Your 8 conversational transcripts)
